  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malaysia and Thailand Reform Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will provide a multi-year program for Australia to engage with Malaysia and Thailand in supporting critical reforms for inclusive growth and ongoing development. It will provide a flexible, adaptive platform to facilitate transformative policy solutions for up to six selected reform areas.
The estimated value of this investment is $2.74 million to be expensed over three years, commencing in the 2019-2020 finanical year.</narrative>
  </description>
